  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile (config_002) outperforms singleprofile (config_001) for RNA-only models. This experiment tests whether replacing avgpool (used in config_002) with transformer aggregation further improves performance in multiprofile RNA-only models. It isolates the effect of aggregation method, a critical design choice, while keeping RNA encoder and profile setting consistent. This clarifies whether more complex aggregation mechanisms provide incremental gains, balancing exploration of key components with exploitation of the promising multiprofile direction."
